3. Provided default values for all form fields
4. Updated the eventType object to include a non-null recurringEvent with default values
5. Added additional form fields that might be required by the component
6. Set proper enum values for the frequency field

This should provide all the necessary context and data that the EventRecurringTab component expects. The error was likely occurring because some required fields or structure was missing in the form context.

